          "text": "Compare your actual open-before record with a fresh test of the repaired path. Read the repeater explanation and choose what the machine can do about an unchanged severed conductor. Your proposal is recorded for the comparison; the test decides whether it is supported. No proposal performs an inspection or restores service.",
